### =============================================================================
### Antigravity Node.js - Localhost API Testing (REST Client)
### =============================================================================
### Instructions:
### In VS Code / Antigravity with the "REST Client" extension installed,
### click "Send Request" above any block to execute the request immediately.
### =============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

### 1. Health Check & Primary Mongo Cluster Latency
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Measure Round-Trip Latency to Any Tenant Database
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ping/prod_jobiak_ai

### 3. List All Configured Multi-Tenant Clients
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clients

### 4. Trigger Feed Reconciliation (Dry-run or Audit)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/feed/summary

### 5. Trigger Monthly Unique Views Report (Tarun's Portfolio)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/run/views
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lead": "tarun"
}

### 6. Trigger Sliding-Window Job Updates (7 Days)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/run/updates
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "days": 7
}

### 7. Trigger Zero-Click Expiry Audit (Threshold: 30 Days)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/run/expires
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "threshold": 30,
  "commit": false
}

### 8. Trigger Full Daily Proxy Pipeline (Updates -> Expires)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/run/pipeline
